{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14039","headline":"喜侯十七校书见访 · 耿湋","name":"喜侯十七校书见访","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东城独屏居，有客到吾庐。\n发廪因舂黍，开畦复翦蔬。\n许酣令乞酒，辞窭任无鱼。\n徧出新成句，更通未悟书。\n藤丝秋不长，竹粉雨仍余。\n谁爲须张烛，凉空有望舒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14039.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14039","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}